		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμπληγάδες</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				421
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κυάνεαι ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
